abbrev RamifiedNineGroup := ZMod 3 × ZMod 3
abbrev RamifiedNineAlgebra := AddMonoidAlgebra ℂ RamifiedNineGroup

/-- The literal normalized nine-seed tau table as a finite convolution
kernel. The normalization removes the universal factor 3^(5/2) and the
archimedean growth 3^(r/6). -/
def literalNineKernel : RamifiedNineAlgebra :=
